OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain dying
OL,6,Fout and cloud breaking with the chance
OL,7,Fof some evening sun towards East
OL,8,FLothian. Clear spells overnight, but a
OL,9,Ffew showers too, windy at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA blustery day with showers
OL,12,Fand strong, gusty winds, perhaps some
OL,13,Fshelter for the Borders, mainly dry
OL,14,Fwith sunshine here.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStarting
OL,17,Fshowery again Sunday but brightening
OL,18,Fup and winds easing in the afternoon,
OL,19,Fa pleasant end to the weekend. Some
OL,20,Fspells of rain and westerly winds for
OL,21,Fthe new week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
